#. inDungeon
msgctxt "564004"
msgid "Mikooon!! Stop, stop, Darling!\nNo one's allowed in there, period! Keep out!!!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "564316"
msgid "Gorgeous treasure?\nW-wait, even for me, this is a bit too fabulous…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "564712"
msgid "Y-you blockhead!\nDon't stare so much!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "564848"
msgid "#C236196003S-Saber#CDEF…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "564884"
msgid "Why can I hear #C236196003Saber#CDEF's voice!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "565128"
msgid "You focus on commanding in your battles.\nOh please, knowing you, it will be fi… ne…\n…wait. Are you alone?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "565400"
msgid "W-what do I do…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "565576"
msgid "For now, there are no immune programs\ndeployed in your area!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566008"
msgid "#C236196003A-Archer#CDEF…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566044"
msgid "Why can I hear #C236196003Archer#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566732"
msgid "W-what do I do…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "566960"
msgid "No worries, stay cool.\nYou're outside of any immune program's\npatrol route."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567264"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567512"
msgid "Now, give in and whisper of love for #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF!\nThen, you can slowly disrobe and inspect\nthe texture of the walls! It's A-OK!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567932"
msgid "Anyway, let's press on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "567960"
msgid "Wahh! Wait, WAIT!\nIt's dangerous to walk around alone!\nAnd please don't ignore meeeee!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "568548"
msgid "There's no one there.\n#C236196003Caster#CDEF of course won't be here, but I don't see the\nfamiliar #C236196003Rin#CDEF said she would send with me…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "568700"
msgid "W-what do I do…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "569340"
msgid "I-it's okay, you're okay there!\nI think you're outside the immune\nprograms' patrol route."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "569432"
msgid "It's #C236196003Rin#CDEF―there may be some lag time\nbefore materializing the familiar.\nHelp is on the way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "569868"
msgid "#C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "569908"
msgid "Why can I hear #C236196003Gilgamesh#CDEF's voice!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "570044"
msgid "My body may be frozen, but I'm always\ndiscerning. Although, all I can do is\nlook about."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "570452"
msgid "W-what do I do…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571400"
msgid "M-my ears, my EARS are SPLITTING…!\nT-this toxic, ultraviolet voice―\nDon't tell me…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571704"
msgid "A familiar voice echoes from the cube…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571752"
msgid "I say―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "571816"
msgid "I'm sure, I'm sure!\nIt's just as #C236196003Rin#CDEF said. Goodness,\nyou'll never make it without me, #[piggy][squirrely]#!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572068"
msgid "Don't you long for a cute, dependable, strong,\nand also cute idol Servant?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572156"
msgid "A familiar voice echoes from the cube once more…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "572208"
msgid "I say―"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "572244"
msgid "Please, spare me."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "573052"
msgid "Seriously, please spare me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573652"
msgid "The cube's rotation reaches its peak."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573944"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573964"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "573984"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574004"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574024"
msgid "…………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574132"
msgid "She points right at me, and I unconsciously clap."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "574660"
msgid "What's your angle, anyway!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575384"
msgid "Yeah. That's right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575476"
msgid "How did she break the seal, and why is she lending me a hand?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575772"
msgid "…I can't believe it.\n#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF is going to fight as a\nServant for #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575904"
msgid "But…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576092"
msgid "But we can't do that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576280"
msgid "And I'm not getting time served.\nI've got a life sentence, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576384"
msgid "???"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577836"
msgid "Give thanks.\nGo forth and fulfill your new desire."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577888"
msgid "…I was not expecting to see a time where\nI would pair up with #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578568"
msgid "D-don't move so wildly!\nI-it's embarrassing for me!\nNo running or striking cool poses!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578656"
msgid "Be reasonable, #C236196003Saber#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578900"
msgid "If all you eat is greasy food,\nyou'll start having a messy style."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579264"
msgid "エミヤの反応（仮）"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579284"
msgid "No, Darling, you mustn't go there鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579504"
msgid "Are you stupid?\nWell, you always totally were."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579552"
msgid "Everyone knows that flab is ugly no\nmatter where it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579800"
msgid "Not \"as if\"―you actually DO have scales!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579956"
msgid "ギルガメッシュの反応（仮）"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581492"
msgid "Thinking about it now,\npairing up with those two―especially #C236196003Rin#CDEF,\nwho showed me respect―was fun."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581608"
msgid "…actually, #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF were the only\nones who pampered me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581712"
msgid "…o-oh, is that so…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581860"
msgid "…damn.\nI may be feeling a bit of sympathy for #C236196003Lancer#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581944"
msgid "Well, I DID betray my first Master.\nI deserve what I got."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582016"
msgid "…hey.\nCan I ask you something?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582396"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF's voice was composed and serious,\nwith none of her trademark high-and-mighty attitude."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582508"
msgid "…her historical self may have been rational like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582616"
msgid "I can't… but I don't know precisely what to say."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582876"
msgid "…hmmm. Sounds good.\nI wish you would've told me that last\ntime we fought."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582960"
msgid "#C236196003Lancer#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582992"
msgid "Forget it.\nC'mon, break time is over.\nLet's get a move on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583468"
msgid "―――The air grows tense."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583744"
msgid "I can―――only enter―――\nBeyond he―――rest is up to―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583884"
msgid "Master, from this point―――\nyou, alone―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583940"
msgid "Oh? I suddenly can't see well…\nActually… I'm, like… getting sleepy…\nOh… up ahead is my…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584124"
msgid "I heard #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's voice so clearly before,\nbut now it's going in and out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584476"
msgid "Darling, be careful―――\nI await your return―――"
msgstr ""

